            <p></p><h2><b>ECOM E01GP-S+ 1-PON Port GPON OLT – Compact, High-Performance Fiber Access Solution</b></h2>The ECOM E01GP-S+ GPON OLT is a compact and reliable optical line terminal designed for high-speed fiber access networks. Featuring 1 GPON PON port, 2 copper Gigabit Ethernet (GE) ports, and 1 uplink 10GE SFP+ port, this OLT is ideal for small-scale FTTH (Fiber to the Home) deployments, enterprise networking, or campus environments.<p></p>\n<p>With its 240V AC single power supply and efficient design, the ECOM E01GP-S+ ensures consistent performance and low energy consumption. Designed and manufactured in China, this device delivers reliable performance backed by a 24-month limited warranty.</p>\n<p></p><h3><b>Key Features:</b></h3><ul><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 × GPON PON Port – Supports up to 128 ONUs per port</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">2 × 10/100/1000Mbps Copper GE Ports – For flexible local network integration</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">1 × 10GE SFP+ Uplink Port – High-speed uplink to core networks</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">240V AC Single Power Supply – Reliable and energy-efficient power support</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Compact Design – Easy to deploy in space-constrained environments</span></li><li><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\">Made in China – Built to international quality standards</span></li></ul>\n              "},{"title":"Product Table","active":false,"cls":"tab-4","noExpand":false,"kind":"compat","title2":"Product List","head":["","Price"],"rows":[{"name":"VSOL V1600G1-B 8 Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600g1-b-8-port-gpon-olt","now":"125,000৳","old":"128,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GS-F Single PON GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gs-f-single-pon-gpon-olt","now":"33,000৳","old":"35,000৳","single":""},{"name":"VSOL V1600GT 2-Port GPON OLT","href":"/vsol-v1600gt-2-port-gpon-olt","now":"54,000৳","old":"57,000৳","single":""},{"name":"V